# 📋 Project Management Tool

A full-stack web application designed to help users **create projects, organize tasks, track progress, and manage project activities** through a centralized dashboard.

🌐 **Live Demo:** https://project-management-frontend-jhvh.onrender.com/

---

## 📌 Overview

The **Project Management Tool** is a web-based application developed to simplify project and task management.

The application provides a centralized workspace where users can organize their projects, create and manage tasks, monitor progress, and keep track of ongoing work.

The goal of the project is to provide a simple and user-friendly alternative to managing projects through scattered notes, spreadsheets, and separate task lists.

Project management applications commonly organize work around projects, tasks, assignments, priorities, deadlines, and progress tracking.

---

## ✨ Features

### 📊 Project Dashboard

A centralized dashboard provides an overview of project-related activities and helps users quickly understand the current state of their work.

### 📁 Project Management

Users can organize their work into separate projects, making it easier to manage multiple activities independently.

### ✅ Task Management

Tasks can be created and organized within projects so that larger projects can be broken down into smaller and manageable pieces.

### 👤 Task Assignment

Tasks can be associated with users or team members, helping clarify responsibility for individual pieces of work.

### 📅 Task Tracking

Tasks can be monitored based on their status and progress, making it easier to identify what has been completed and what still needs attention.

### 🎯 Priority Management

Tasks can be organized according to their importance so that users can focus on higher-priority work first.

### 🔄 Project Progress

The application provides a way to monitor ongoing project activity and track progress toward completion.

### 🖥️ Responsive Interface

The application is designed as a web-based interface that can be accessed through a modern browser.

