# 🔄 Application Workflow

```text
User
  ↓
Register / Login
  ↓
Authentication
  ↓
Dashboard
  ↓
Create / Manage Projects
  ↓
Create Tasks
  ↓
Assign & Organize Tasks
  ↓
Track Task Status
  ↓
Monitor Project Progress
```

---

# 🔐 Authentication

The application uses authentication to protect user-specific project information.

The authentication flow includes:

```text
User Registration
       ↓
User Login
       ↓
Authentication
       ↓
JWT Token
       ↓
Authenticated Requests
       ↓
Protected Resources
```

JWT can be used to securely represent the authenticated user's session when communicating between the frontend and backend.

